{
  "_doc_emerald": [
    "Emerald's overlay of data/hoenn_music.json (emerald_art_music, 2026-10-12): deep-merged over it by version.load_json in HOENN_VERSION=emerald builds; only what Emerald adds or changes. Sapphire and Ruby never read it.",
    "songs.<song>.rom = 'emerald' (proposed key): convert this song from the user's Emerald dump (roms/emerald_original.gba, b2tools/m4a_emerald.EmeraldRom) instead of Sapphire's; songs without it stay Sapphire's. The 5 new story songs, and 6 shared songs whose Emerald version differs (b2tools/m4a_emerald.py compare): mus_evolved (louder velocities in tracks 0-2, ends 72 ticks later), mus_level_up / mus_obtain_item (same notes, end 24 ticks later), mus_vs_trainer / mus_vs_aqua_magma (a square part sustains at 15 instead of 7: louder), mus_encounter_champion (vibrato reset at the loop start).",
    "defaults: Emerald's church organ (mus_rayquaza_appears; no Sapphire twin) -> 17 organ, the library's identified organ (Sapphire's sc88pro_organ2 plays it too).",
    "gains (proposed key, same keys and meaning as data/hoenn_music_gains.json 'gains'): music_calib.py's whole-part balance computed from the Emerald dump (b2tools/m4a_emerald.py gains, same ref); for the new songs every part, for the shared songs only the parts whose Emerald value differs. The machinery merges them over the levels' gains_table.",
    "slots: 4 of the 5 new songs in the next free pool entries in song-table order (music_slots.py's rule). wild: Mew gets Emerald's own battle theme (pokeemerald battle_setup.c). zone_rules.crisis_song: Emerald's crisis song (overworld.c GetLocationMusic: MUS_ABNORMAL_WEATHER). reverse: Unova stand-ins that also end, for scripts that name the two new non-looping songs' slots.",
    "mus_vs_rayquaza is not here (emerald_art, 2026-10-12): Emerald's Rayquaza battle music is note for note Ruby/Sapphire's mus_vs_kyogre_groudon (m4a_emerald.compare finds no difference in notes, tempo, voices or loop), so Rayquaza (384) keeps the base file's mus_vs_kyogre_groudon and its 136,620 B of music room stay free.",
    "The Battle Frontier's 13 songs (frontier_core_music, 2026-10-12; notes/FRONTIER.md section 5): songs.<song>.rom = 'emerald'; Emerald's new tower song (pokeemerald mus_b_tower, id 465) under the key mus_b_tower_frontier with rom_name mus_b_tower, since mus_b_tower here is Ruby/Sapphire's tower song (Emerald's mus_b_tower_rs, still played in Emerald's lounges, Exchange Service Corner, Reception Gate and Scott's house). slots: the next free pool entries in song-table order (music_slots.py's rule). No Frontier song shares music with another song (checked note for note).",
    "defaults {\"gba\": true}: the 10 voices the Frontier songs play that Black 2's library has no instrument for (choir, female voice, gamelan, detuned electric piano, distortion / overdrive guitars, shakuhachi, koto) play Emerald's own samples from the user's dump with their own envelopes (b2tools/m4a_emerald.py EmeraldSong). gba_instruments.level_k: the Black 2 level of such a note = level_k x m4a_emerald.nds_note_rms (median of measured / rendered over the 318 measured melodic library notes of data/hoenn_music_levels.json, all within +-0.6 dB; work/agents/frontier_core/music/scripts/calib_k.py).",
    "archive_reserve: Emerald's sound archive grows by this many bytes after its last file (patches/hoenn_music.archive_reserve): the 125 songs need about 2.3 MB more than the pool's free bytes. songs.mus_b_pyramid.drums: its 6 tom notes on two toms and its 6 Chinese-cymbal notes on the orchestra crash, so the song needs 250,848 B of sound memory instead of 289,292 (one song gets about 282 KB, notes/MUSIC.md).",
    "zone_songs: Emerald's island (zone 17, both halves) plays mus_b_frontier, the Battle Tower's lobby / elevator / corridor / battle room (21, 343, 336, 15) Emerald's tower song, the Exchange Service Corner (419) Ruby/Sapphire's tower song as Emerald does. reverse: the two Frontier fanfares get Black 2's badge and BP jingles with the Unova answer (both end).",
    "classes (frontier_core, 2026-10-12): the seven Frontier Brains' classes (converter/gen_trainers.py FRONTIER_BRAINS: 7 Dome Ace, 8 Palace Maven, 9 Salon Maiden, 30 Pyramid King, 31 Pike Queen, 33 Factory Head, 34 Arena Tycoon) battle to Emerald's mus_vs_frontier_brain (pokeemerald pokemon.c GetBattleBGM: TRAINER_CLASS_FRONTIER_BRAIN), with the Hoenn music answer."
  ],
